"エンドポイント・引数・答えの欄を**足す**（前からある呼ぶ側は、知らない欄を読"
"み飛ばす）"
msgstr ""
"**Add** an endpoint, parameter, or response field (existing callers skip "
"fields they do not know)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "上げない"
msgstr "No bump"

#: src/api.md
msgid "エンドポイント・引数・答えの欄を消す、名や型を変える"
msgstr ""
"Remove an endpoint, parameter, or response field, or change its name or type"

#: src/api.md
msgid "上げる"
msgstr "Bump"

#: src/api.md
msgid "code の意味を変える（`409` が別の訳で返る、など）"
msgstr ""
"Change the meaning of a code (e.g. `409` is returned for a different reason)"

