msgstr ""
"Bump (this breaks the references inside pages, so it is practically never "
"done)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "受ける file の種類を減らす"
msgstr "Accept fewer file types"

#: src/api.md
msgid "上げる（前は通った file が通らなくなる）"
msgstr "Bump (files that used to be accepted are rejected)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "引数の字の決まりを厳しくする（前は通った字が通らなくなる）"
msgstr ""
"Tighten the character rules for a parameter (characters that used to be "
"accepted are rejected)"

#: src/api.md
