msgid ""
"ページと file を置く時に、呼ぶ側は、置く人を指す付随する id（`actor_issuer`・"
"`actor_ref`）を書ける（0.6.0 から。書かなくてよい）。置き場は、受けたその時"
"に [castlist](glossary.md)（アクターの本当の id と名を持つ、pagetray を動かす"
"機械の別の container のサーバー。聞く先は `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`）に送り手を"
"聞き、答えを残す。後から castlist の答えが変わっても、残した物は変えない。"
msgstr ""
"When putting a page or a file, the caller may write an attached id that "
"points to whoever puts it (`actor_issuer`, `actor_ref`) (since 0.6.0; "
"optional). At the moment it receives the request, the store asks [castlist]"
"(glossary.md) (a server in another container on the machine that runs "
"pagetray, holding the true id and name of each actor; the address asked is "
"`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`) for the sender and records the answer. Even if "
"castlist's answer changes later, what was recorded is not changed."

