msgid ""
"`name` は名の語、`ext` は拡張子、`n` は名と拡張子ごとの番号。`type` は返す時"
"の `Content-Type`（拡張子から決まる）。`sha256` は中身の SHA-256（16 進の小文"
"字。サーバーが数える）。"
msgstr ""
"`name` is the stem of the name, `ext` is the extension, and `n` is the "
"number per name and extension. `type` is the `Content-Type` the file is "
"served with (decided by the extension). `sha256` is the SHA-256 of the "
"contents (lowercase hex, computed by the server)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`path` は、このサーバーの中の path。ページの URL（3 段）と違い、4 段目に "
"`files/` を持つので、ぶつからない。"
msgstr ""
"`path` is the path within this server. Unlike page URLs (three segments), it "
"has `files/` as an extra segment, so the two never collide."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"ページからは、相対の path で参照する（同じ Key なら `files/screen-1.png`、別"
"の Key なら `../K-2/files/screen-1.png`）。"
msgstr ""
"Pages refer to files by relative path (`files/screen-1.png` for the same "
"Key, `../K-2/files/screen-1.png` for another Key)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "受ける file の種類"
msgstr "Accepted file types"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"拡張子がこの表に無い file は受けない（動画・HTML・SVG など）。1 つ 16 MiB ま"
"で。"
msgstr ""
"Files whose extension is not in this table are rejected (video, HTML, SVG "
"and so on). Up to 16 MiB per file."

#: src/api.md
msgid "拡張子"
msgstr "Extension"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`Content-Type`"
msgstr "`Content-Type`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "中身の見方"
msgstr "Contents check"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`png`"
msgstr "`png`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`image/png`"
msgstr "`image/png`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "頭の 8 byte が PNG の印"
msgstr "The first 8 bytes are the PNG signature"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`jpg`・`jpeg`"
msgstr "`jpg`, `jpeg`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`image/jpeg`"
msgstr "`image/jpeg`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "頭が `FF D8 FF`"
msgstr "Starts with `FF D8 FF`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`gif`"
msgstr "`gif`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`image/gif`"
msgstr "`image/gif`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "頭が `GIF87a` か `GIF89a`"
msgstr "Starts with `GIF87a` or `GIF89a`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`webp`"
msgstr "`webp`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`image/webp`"
msgstr "`image/webp`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "頭が `RIFF`、9〜12 byte 目が `WEBP`"
msgstr "Starts with `RIFF`, and bytes 9–12 are `WEBP`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`pdf`"
msgstr "`pdf`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`application/pdf`"
msgstr "`application/pdf`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "頭が `%PDF-`"
msgstr "Starts with `%PDF-`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`txt`・`log`"
msgstr "`txt`, `log`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`text/plain; charset=utf-8`"
msgstr "`text/plain; charset=utf-8`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "UTF-8 として読めて、NUL を含まない"
msgstr "Valid UTF-8 with no NUL"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`md`"
msgstr "`md`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`text/markdown; charset=utf-8`"
msgstr "`text/markdown; charset=utf-8`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "同じ"
msgstr "Same"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`csv`"
msgstr "`csv`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`text/csv; charset=utf-8`"
msgstr "`text/csv; charset=utf-8`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`json`"
msgstr "`json`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`application/json; charset=utf-8`"
msgstr "`application/json; charset=utf-8`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`POST /api/pages` — 置く"
msgstr "`POST /api/pages` — put"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数（query）: `project`・`key`・`kind`・`role`（要る）、`workspace`（無けれ"
"ば空）、`n`・`created_at`（取り込みの時だけ）、`actor_issuer`・`actor_ref`"
"（送り手。両方書くか、両方書かない。0.6.0 から）。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters (query): `project`, `key`, `kind`, `role` (required); `workspace` "
"(empty if omitted); `n`, `created_at` (import only); `actor_issuer`, "
"`actor_ref` (the sender; write both or neither; since 0.6.0)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "本文: HTML（1 枚 16 MiB まで。空は駄目）。"
msgstr "Body: HTML (up to 16 MiB per page; must not be empty)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`n` が無ければ、その `project`・`key`・`kind` の「今の最大 ＋ 1」を付ける。最"
"大は、消したページの番号も数える（同じ番号を 2 度使わない）。"
msgstr ""
"If `n` is omitted, the page is given \"current maximum + 1\" for that "
"`project`, `key`, and `kind`. The maximum also counts the numbers of deleted "
"pages (the same number is never used twice)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`201`: ページの記録に `url`（要求の `Host` で組んだ URL）を足した JSON。"
"header `Location` も同じ URL。"
msgstr ""
"`201`: JSON of the page record plus `url` (a URL built from the request's "
"`Host`). The `Location` header carries the same URL."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`409`: `n` を名指して、その番号が使われている（置いてある・消した）。"
msgstr ""
"`409`: `n` was given explicitly and that number is already used (by a page "
"that is stored or was deleted)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`400`: 引数が決まりに合わない・本文が空・`actor_issuer` と `actor_ref` の片方"
"だけ。`413`: 本文が大きすぎる。"
msgstr ""
"`400`: a parameter violates the rules, the body is empty, or only one of "
"`actor_issuer` and `actor_ref` is given. `413`: the body is too large."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`422`: castlist に登録の無い送り手。`503`: castlist に聞けない（上の「送り"
"手」）。どちらも何も置かない。"
msgstr ""
"`422`: a sender not registered in castlist. `503`: castlist cannot be asked "
"(\"Senders\" above). In both cases nothing is stored."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`GET /api/pages` — 探す"
msgstr "`GET /api/pages` — list"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数（みな任意）: `project`・`key`・`kind`・`role`・`workspace`（同じ物だ"
"け）、`q`（題と本文の字を探す）、`sort`（`-created_at` 新しい順＝既定・"
"`created_at` 古い順）、`limit`（既定 100・1〜1000 に丸める）、`before`・"
"`after`（`created_at` がそれより前・後）、`reply`（返事の状態。`waiting` は返"
"事待ち、`answered` は答えた物だけ。0.5.0 から）、`actor`（castlist のアクター"
"の id。その送り手が置いた物だけ。未確認の送り手は当たらない。0.6.0 から）。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters (all optional): `project`, `key`, `kind`, `role`, `workspace` "
"(exact match only), `q` (searches the text of the title and body), `sort` (`-"
"created_at` newest first = default, `created_at` oldest first), `limit` "
"(default 100; clamped to 1–1000), `before`, `after` (`created_at` earlier or "
"later than the given value), `reply` (the reply state: `waiting` for pages "
"waiting for a reply only, `answered` for answered pages only; since 0.5.0), "
"`actor` (a castlist actor id: only what that sender put; unconfirmed senders "
"never match; since 0.6.0)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`200`: `{\"pages\":[<ページの記録>, …]}`。合う物が無ければ空の配列。"
msgstr ""
"`200`: `{\"pages\":[<page record>, …]}`. An empty array if nothing matches."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`400`: `sort` がどちらでもない・`reply` がどちらでもない。"
msgstr ""
"`400`: `sort` is neither of the two values, or `reply` is neither of the two "
"values."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`POST /api/pages/reply` — 返事の状態を書く"
msgstr "`POST /api/pages/reply` — write the reply state"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"Product Manager の返事が要るページに、返事待ち・答えたの状態を書く（0.5.0 か"
"ら）。roster の `tpm ask pm` が返事待ちにし、`tpm answer` が答えたにする。一"
"覧の UI は、この状態で印と件数を出す。"
msgstr ""
"Writes the waiting / answered state on a page that needs a reply from the "
"Product Manager (since 0.5.0). In roster, `tpm ask pm` marks a page as "
"waiting and `tpm answer` marks it as answered. The list UI shows its marks "
"and counts from this state."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数（query。みな要る）: `project`・`key`・`kind`・`n`（ページ 1 枚を名指"
"す）、`state`（`waiting` 返事待ち・`answered` 答えた）。本文は読まない。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters (query; all required): `project`, `key`, `kind`, `n` (naming one "
"page), `state` (`waiting` or `answered`). The body is not read."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`waiting`: 返事待ちにする。もう返事待ちなら何も変えない。答えた後にもう 1 度"
"書くと、`asked_at` が今になり、`answered_at` が消える。"
msgstr ""
"`waiting`: marks the page as waiting for a reply. Changes nothing if it is "
"already waiting. Written again after an answer, `asked_at` becomes the "
"current time and `answered_at` is cleared."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`answered`: 答えたにする。もう答えていれば何も変えない。返事待ちにしていない"
"ページなら、`asked_at` にも同じ時刻が入る。"
msgstr ""
"`answered`: marks the page as answered. Changes nothing if it is already "
"answered. On a page that was never marked as waiting, `asked_at` gets the "
"same time."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`200`: そのページの記録（`asked_at`・`answered_at` が付く）。同じ状態を 2 度"
"書いても同じ答え。"
msgstr ""
"`200`: the record of that page (with `asked_at` and `answered_at`). Writing "
"the same state twice gives the same response."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`404`: そのページは無い（消した物も）。`400`: 引数が決まりに合わない。"
msgstr ""
"`404`: there is no such page (deleted pages included). `400`: a parameter "
"violates the rules."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"だれが書いてよいかは見ない（呼ぶ側が決める）。browser の中のページからは書け"
"ない（「共通」の `Origin` の決まり）。"
msgstr ""
"Who may write is not checked (the caller decides). A page inside a browser "
"cannot write (the `Origin` rule under \"Common\")."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"0.5.0 より前のサーバーには、このエンドポイントが無い（`404` か `405` が返"
"る）。呼ぶ側は、それを「状態を書けない置き場」として扱う。"
msgstr ""
"Servers before 0.5.0 do not have this endpoint (they return `404` or `405`). "
"A caller treats that as a store that cannot hold the state."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`DELETE /api/pages` — 消す"
msgstr "`DELETE /api/pages` — delete"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数: `project`（要る）、`key`・`kind`・`n`（任意。`n` を書く時は `key` と "
"`kind` も要る）。合うページをみな消す。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters: `project` (required); `key`, `kind`, `n` (optional; when `n` is "
"given, `key` and `kind` are also required). Deletes every matching page."

#: src/api.md
msgid "本文は残さない（戻せない）。番号は残り、同じ番号は 2 度使わない。"
msgstr ""
"The body is not kept (it cannot be restored). The number remains, and the "
"same number is never used twice."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`200`: `{\"removed\":[\"<path>\", …]}`。合う物が無ければ空の配列。"
msgstr ""
"`200`: `{\"removed\":[\"<path>\", …]}`. An empty array if nothing matches."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`400`: 引数が決まりに合わない。"
msgstr "`400`: a parameter violates the rules."

#: src/api.md
msgid "だれが消してよいかは見ない（呼ぶ側が決める）。"
msgstr "The server does not check who is allowed to delete (callers decide)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`GET /<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>.html` — 本文"
msgstr "`GET /<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>.html` — body"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`200`: 置いた HTML をそのまま（`Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8`、"
"`Content-Security-Policy: sandbox allow-scripts`）。"
msgstr ""
"`200`: the HTML exactly as it was put (`Content-Type: text/html; "
"charset=utf-8`, `Content-Security-Policy: sandbox allow-scripts`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`404`: 無い。`410`: 消した。"
msgstr "`404`: does not exist. `410`: deleted."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`POST /api/files` — file を置く"
msgstr "`POST /api/files` — put a file"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数（query）: `project`・`key`・`name`（`<語>.<拡張子>`）・`role`（要る）、"
"`workspace`（無ければ空）、`n`・`created_at`（取り込みの時だけ）、"
"`actor_issuer`・`actor_ref`（送り手。`POST /api/pages` と同じ。0.6.0 から）。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters (query): `project`, `key`, `name` (`<stem>.<ext>`), `role` "
"(required); `workspace` (empty if omitted); `n`, `created_at` (import only); "
"`actor_issuer`, `actor_ref` (the sender; same as `POST /api/pages`; since "
"0.6.0)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"本文: file の中身そのもの（1 つ 16 MiB まで。空は駄目）。header `Content-"
"Type` が要る。"
msgstr ""
"Body: the file contents as is (up to 16 MiB per file; must not be empty). "
"The `Content-Type` header is required."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`n` が無ければ、その `project`・`key`・語・拡張子の「今の最大 ＋ 1」を付ける"
"（`screen.png` を置くと `screen-1.png`、もう 1 度置くと `screen-2.png`。前の"
"物は残る）。最大は、消した file の番号も数える。"
msgstr ""
"Without `n`, the file gets \"current maximum + 1\" for that `project`, "
"`key`, stem and extension (putting `screen.png` gives `screen-1.png`; "
"putting it again gives `screen-2.png`, and the earlier one stays). The "
"maximum also counts the numbers of deleted files."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`201`: file の記録に `url`（要求の `Host` で組んだ URL）を足した JSON。"
"header `Location` も同じ URL。"
msgstr ""
"`201`: JSON of the file record plus `url` (a URL built from the request's "
"`Host`). The `Location` header carries the same URL."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`409`: `n` を名指して、その番号が使われている（置いてある file・消した "
"file）。"
msgstr ""
"`409`: `n` was given explicitly and that number is already used (by a file "
"that is stored or was deleted)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`400`: 引数が決まりに合わない・本文が空・`Content-Type` が無い・"
"`actor_issuer` と `actor_ref` の片方だけ。`413`: 本文が大きすぎる。"
msgstr ""
"`400`: a parameter violates the rules, the body is empty, `Content-Type` is "
"missing, or only one of `actor_issuer` and `actor_ref` is given. `413`: the "
"body is too large."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`422`・`503`: 送り手を castlist に聞いた答え（上の「送り手」）。castlist に"
"は、ほかの決まり（`400`・`415`）を見終えてから聞く。"
msgstr ""
"`422`, `503`: the result of asking castlist for the sender (\"Senders\" "
"above). castlist is asked only after the other rules (`400`, `415`) have "
"been checked."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`415`: 拡張子を受けない、`Content-Type` の種類（`;` の前。大文字・小文字は問"
"わない）が拡張子の物と違う、中身が拡張子の形でない。"
msgstr ""
"`415`: the extension is not accepted, the media type of `Content-Type` (the "
"part before `;`, compared case-insensitively) differs from the extension's, "
"or the contents do not match the extension."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"一覧の UI から上げた物（上の「共通」の例外）は、引数に何が書いてあっても、"
"`role` を `product-manager`、`workspace` を空で記録する（browser から担当を名"
"乗らせない）。`n`・`created_at`・`actor_issuer`・`actor_ref` も読まない（番号"
"と時刻は置き場が決め、送り手は記録しない）。`role` は書かなくてよい。"
msgstr ""
"An upload from the list UI (the exception under \"Common rules\" above) is "
"recorded with `role` `product-manager` and an empty `workspace`, whatever "
"the arguments say (a browser cannot claim to be a role). `n`, `created_at`, "
"`actor_issuer`, and `actor_ref` are ignored too (the store decides the "
"number and the time, and no sender is recorded). `role` may be left out."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`GET /api/files` — file を探す"
msgstr "`GET /api/files` — list files"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数（みな任意）: `project`・`key`・`role`・`workspace`（同じ物だけ）、`q`"
"（名 `<語>.<拡張子>` の字を探す）、`actor`・`sort`・`limit`・`before`・"
"`after`（`GET /api/pages` と同じ）。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters (all optional): `project`, `key`, `role`, `workspace` (exact "
"match only), `q` (searches the name `<stem>.<ext>`), `actor`, `sort`, "
"`limit`, `before`, `after` (same as `GET /api/pages`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "file の記録にも、送り手を記録した物には `sender` が出る（0.6.0 から）。"
msgstr ""
"File records, too, carry `sender` when a sender was recorded (since 0.6.0)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`200`: `{\"files\":[<file の記録>, …]}`。合う物が無ければ空の配列。"
msgstr ""
"`200`: `{\"files\":[<file record>, …]}`. An empty array if nothing matches."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`400`: `sort` がどちらでもない。"
msgstr "`400`: `sort` is neither of the two values."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`DELETE /api/files` — file を消す"
msgstr "`DELETE /api/files` — delete files"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数: `project`（要る）、`key`・`name`（`<語>.<拡張子>`）・`n`（任意。`n` を"
"書く時は `key` と `name` も要る）。合う file をみな消す。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters: `project` (required); `key`, `name` (`<stem>.<ext>`), `n` "
"(optional; when `n` is given, `key` and `name` are also required). Deletes "
"every matching file."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"中身は残さない（戻せない）。番号は残り、同じ番号は 2 度使わない。ページは消さ"
"ない（ページを消しても file は消えない）。"
msgstr ""
"The contents are not kept (they cannot be restored). The number remains, and "
"the same number is never used twice. Pages are not deleted (and deleting a "
"page does not delete files)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`GET /<project>/<key>/files/<語>-<n>.<拡張子>` — file の中身"
msgstr "`GET /<project>/<key>/files/<stem>-<n>.<ext>` — file contents"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`200`: 置いた中身をそのまま。`Content-Type` は上の表の物、`Content-Security-"
"Policy: sandbox`（直に開いても script は動かない）、`X-Content-Type-Options: "
"nosniff`、`Cache-Control: max-age=31536000, immutable`（同じ URL の中身は変わ"
"らない）。"
msgstr ""
"`200`: the stored contents as is. `Content-Type` is the one from the table "
"above, with `Content-Security-Policy: sandbox` (scripts do not run even when "
"opened directly), `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`, and `Cache-Control: max-"
"age=31536000, immutable` (the contents at a URL never change)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "そのほか"
msgstr "Others"

#: src/api.md
msgid "仕様"
msgstr "Specification"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`200` と `ok`"
msgstr "`200` and `ok`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "入る"
msgstr "Covered"

#: src/api.md
msgid "サーバーの版と API の版"
msgstr "Server version and API version"

#: src/api.md
msgid "DB の写し（SQLite の file 1 つ）"
msgstr "Backup of the DB (a single SQLite file)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"置かれるたび・返事の状態が書かれるたびに 1 件を push（SSE）。ページは名の無"
"い event でページの記録、file は `event: file` で file の記録、返事の状態は "
"`event: reply` でページの記録（0.5.0 から）"
msgstr ""
"Pushes one event each time something is put or a reply state is written "
"(SSE): an unnamed event with the page record for a page, `event: file` with "
"the file record for a file, `event: reply` with the page record for a reply "
"state (since 0.5.0)"

#: src/api.md src/glossary.md
msgid "一覧の UI"
msgstr "List UI"

#: src/api.md
msgid "URL が開くことだけ。HTML の作りは入らない"
msgstr "Only that the URL opens. The HTML structure is not covered"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"image と、release に付ける CLI の binary は public で、だれでも取って中を見ら"
"れる。**出すのは release の workflow（`.github/workflows/release.yml`）だけ**"
"で、手元から `push` せず、release に file を手で付けない（手元の build には、"
"commit していない file と、自分の home の path が入りうる）。"
msgstr ""
"The image and the CLI binary attached to a release are public, and anyone "
"can get them and look inside. **Only the release workflow (`.github/"
"workflows/release.yml`) publishes them**; never `push` from your local "
"machine and never attach files to a release by hand (a local build can "
"include files that are not committed, and the path of your own home "
"directory)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"`Cargo.toml` の `[workspace.package]` の `version` を上げ、`CHANGELOG.md` に"
"節を足す PR を merge する。"
msgstr ""
"Merge a PR that bumps `version` under `[workspace.package]` in `Cargo.toml` "
"and adds a section to `CHANGELOG.md`."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"main のその commit に tag を打って push する: `git tag v<version> && git "
"push origin v<version>`。"
msgstr ""
"Tag that commit on main and push the tag: `git tag v<version> && git push "
"origin v<version>`."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"workflow の `check` が、tag と版が合うか・image の中身の一覧・設定・秘密の走"
"査（下の「image に入る物」）・動くかを見る。`check-cli` が、CLI の binary の"
"形・つながる library・版・秘密の走査（下の「release に付ける CLI に入る"
"物」）・動くかを見る。**1 つでも落ちれば、`push` は動かず、image も CLI も出"
"ない。**"
msgstr ""
"The workflow's `check` verifies that the tag matches the version, the "
"image's contents list, its configuration, the secret scan (see \"What goes "
"into the image\" below), and that the image runs. `check-cli` verifies the "
"CLI binary's format, linked libraries, version, the secret scan (see \"What "
"goes into the CLI attached to a release\" below), and that it runs. **If "
"even one of these fails, `push` does not run, and neither the image nor the "
"CLI is published.**"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"`push` が、確かめたその image（作り直さない）を `ghcr.io/uraitakahito/"
"pagetray:v<version>` に置き、release に digest と中身の一覧を書き、確かめたそ"
"の CLI の tar と checksum を付ける。同じ tag がもうあれば置かない。"
msgstr ""
"`push` pushes that verified image (without rebuilding it) to `ghcr.io/"
"uraitakahito/pagetray:v<version>`, writes the digest and the contents list "
"to the release, and attaches that verified CLI tar and its checksum. If the "
"same tag already exists, it does not push."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"release の中身の一覧が「`pagetray-server` と空の `data` だけ」であることと、"
"付いた file が `pagetray-v<version>-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz` とその "
"`.sha256` の 2 つだけであることを見る（この時、image も CLI ももう public。"
"違っていたら、すぐ下の「機微な物が出てしまった時」をする）。"
msgstr ""
"Check that the contents list in the release is \"only `pagetray-server` and "
"an empty `data`\", and that the attached files are only `pagetray-v<version>-"
"aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz` and its `.sha256` (at this point the image and "
"the CLI are already public; if anything differs, do \"If something sensitive "
"got out\" just below)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"roster の `.pagetray-version` を上げる PR を出す（つなぎの試験が、その image "
"に向けて通る）。"
msgstr ""
"Open a PR that bumps `.pagetray-version` in roster (the integration tests "
"run against that image and pass)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"出した tag は打ち直さない（digest が変わり、書き留めた値と合わなくなる）。直"
"す時は、次の版を出す。"
msgstr ""
"Never re-tag a published tag (the digest changes and no longer matches the "
"recorded value). To fix something, publish the next version."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"**機微な物が出てしまった時**: GitHub の package の画面で、その版を消す。CLI "
"の方なら、release の画面で付いた file を消す。秘密なら、すぐ替える（消して"
"も、pull した人の手元には残る前提で動く）。直して次の版を出し、`ci/` の決まり"
"に、同じ物を止める形を足す。"
msgstr ""
"**If something sensitive got out**: Delete that version on the GitHub "
"package page. For the CLI, delete the attached files on the release page. If "
"it is a secret, rotate it immediately (act on the assumption that it remains "
"on the machines of people who pulled it, even after deletion). Fix the "
"problem and publish the next version, and add something to the rules in `ci/"
"` that blocks the same thing."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"**置いた時から public**: この repo は public で、image に repo を指す label "
"を付けて置くので、package は初めの release から、だれでも pull できる"
"（v0.2.0 で確かめた。private の間に人が見る、という段は無い）。人が見られるの"
"は、tag を打つ前だけ。だから、3 の確かめを push の前に置いてあり、決まりを緩"
"める PR（`ci/` の file・`.dockerignore`・`Containerfile`）は、よく見てから "
"merge する。CLI の binary も、release に付いた時から public。"
msgstr ""
"**Public from the moment it is pushed**: This repo is public, and the image "
"is pushed with a label pointing to the repo, so the package can be pulled by "
"anyone from the very first release (verified with v0.2.0; there is no stage "
"where a person reviews it while it is still private). A person can review it "
"only before the tag is created. That is why the checks in step 3 are placed "
"before the push, and why PRs that loosen the rules (files in `ci/`, "
"`.dockerignore`, `Containerfile`) are reviewed carefully before merging. The "
"CLI binary is also public from the moment it is attached to a release."

#: src/release.md
